00:01:39.020 --> 00:01:43.799
Playing the Walking Dead Telltale game is
probably the best way to get prepared for

00:01:43.799 --> 00:01:44.799
the Game of Thrones version.

00:01:44.799 --> 00:01:46.010
It will be mostly the same mechanics.

00:01:46.010 --> 00:01:48.920
A lot of you asked how the game is going to
fit into the canon.

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:53.120
It’s going to have the same relationship
with the books as the show does.

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:57.420
It will take characters from the novels and
write a story arc that loosely follows the

00:01:57.420 --> 00:01:58.810
