00:02:11.620 --> 00:02:15.630
Think of the telltale game as one giant side
story.

00:02:15.630 --> 00:02:22.980
Right now they’re still writing the story
of the game.

00:02:22.980 --> 00:02:36.340
The person they hired to create it is the
same person who wrote the story for Destiny.

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:40.490
Because of the way telltale games narratives
work, they have this choose your own adventure

00:02:40.490 --> 00:03:09.290
model, decisions you make in episode 1 of
the game will affect the story in later episodes.

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:11.800
From a development standpoint, the game is
still in alpha.

00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:13.171
It’s not open to beta testers yet.

00:03:13.171 --> 00:03:18.400
The early release date estimates are December
2014.

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:20.879
There have not been any major delay announcements.

00:03:20.879 --> 00:03:24.440
